==Mossdeep City==
[[File:Mossdeep City RS.png|thumb|Mossdeep City]]
[[File:Mossdeep City Space Center 1F RSE.png|thumb|Mossdeep Space Center, 1F]]
[[File:Mossdeep City Space Center 2F RSE.png|thumb|Mossdeep Space Center, 2F]]

[[Mossdeep City]] sits on an island near [[Hoenn]]'s eastern limits, between {{rt|124|Hoenn}} to the west, {{rt|125|Hoenn}} to the north, and {{rt|127|Hoenn}} to the south. Weather conditions here are consistently clear and stable, making it the perfect place for the [[Mossdeep Space Center]]. The [[Mossdeep Gym]], run by twin [[Gym Leader]]s, is located on the north side of the island. [[Steven Stone|Steven]]'s home can be found in the northwest.

