===A Rock Fit for a King===
Speak to the boy to the west of the Pokémon Center, and he talks about some odd-looking rock that he got from [[Steven Stone|Steven]]. Unsure how to use it, he asks if you would like to have it. Agree to receive the [[King's Rock]].

===Secret Base hunter===
The house to the west of the Pokémon Center is home to a brother and sister. The young boy likes to visit other people's [[Secret Base]]s, and will tell you where your Secret Base is located.

===Steven's house===
The northwestern-most house belongs to [[Steven Stone|Steven]]. When you enter, he greets you and gives you {{HM|08|Dive}}. He explains that in certain bodies of water, there are darker patches where the water is especially deep. Using Dive over one of these spots lets you descend to the ocean floor far below. On the seabed, swim to a lighter patch where the sunlight filters down from above and use Dive again to return to the surface. This move gives you a way to chase after [[Maxie]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Archie]]{{sup/3|S}} in his submarine, but you will need the Badge from the [[Mossdeep Gym]] first!

===Pokéblock specialist===
The house to the north of the Pokémon Center belongs to a couple. The Black Belt is able to discern your lead Pokémon's preferred [[Flavor|color]] of [[Pokéblock]].

===Running Errands===
Visit the easternmost house, at the foot of the stairs to the Space Center. Inside, there is a young woman who uses a {{p|Wingull}} to send letters back and forth to her friend in [[Fortree City]]. Speak to Wingull and it will leave, setting off to deliver another note. If you return to Fortree City and speak to the young man in the northeast treehouse, he gives you a [[Mental Herb]] that the Seagull Pokémon found in its travels.

===Score the Super Rod===
Visit the northeast house and speak to the Fisherman inside to receive a [[Super Rod]]. This high-end fishing rod is the best model available and can reel in some of the strongest sea creatures.

===Mossdeep Space Center===
The [[Mossdeep Space Center]] stands on a large hill in the northeast. Speak to the Sailor near the viewing area on 1F to receive a [[Sun Stone]] that he recently found on the beach.

===Mossdeep Gym===
[[File:Mossdeep Gym RS.png|thumb|Mossdeep Gym]]

