After the battle, [[Tate and Liza|Liza and Tate]] award you the {{badge|Mind}}, which boosts a Pokémon's {{stat|Special Attack}} and {{stat|Special Defense}} by 10% during battle and enables the use of {{m|Dive}} in the field. The twins also give you {{TM|04|Calm Mind}} as a prize. Afterward, you can step on the [[warp panel]] to the east for a shortcut to the entrance.

