===Shoal Cave===
[[Shoal Cave]]'s appearance changes with the {{DL|Shoal Cave|tides}}. Seawater floods the cave during high tide, closing off some areas and bringing others within reach. It then drains away during low tide, revealing new areas for exploration. The tides change every six hours, at 3:00 and 9:00.

