=====Chamber 1=====
======The Craftsman======
Speak to the elderly man in the first chamber, and he asks if you are planning to explore the cave. He makes a request: bring him some [[Shoal Salt]]s and [[Shoal Shell]]s, and he will craft something useful for you. Shoal Shells are found at high tide, while Shoal Salts are found at low tide. These resources are replenished each day, so there's no limit to the number collected. Bring him four of each item, and he fashions them into a [[Shell Bell]].

Use {{m|Surf}} and take the northwest doorway to the next chamber.

=====Chamber 2=====
Use {{m|Surf}} again to follow the water in a clockwise direction, collecting the four [[Shoal Shell]]s and a [[Rare Candy]] along the way. Take the southeast doorway back to the entrance chamber to find a [[Big Pearl]] above the ledge.
|}


